& [Delineation]
  + configuration validation reads and evaluates existing operator-selected artifacts
  + configuration generation repair migration secret provisioning and installation mutate or create artifacts and remain absent
  + server startup additionally binds a listener and enters a process lifecycle and remains absent
  + a public diagnostic is an intentionally lossy safe projection rather than a raw startup fault transcript

& [DataModel]
  + ConfigurationDiagnosticStatus is Ready or Refused
  + ConfigurationCheck is ordinal closed subject and Passed or Refused
  + PublicDiagnosticFault is code stage subject and closed guidance
  + ReadyConfigurationSummary is schema listener family port limits active binding prepared-runtime metrics and ordered package count
  + DiagnosticPrivacyBoundary is an exhaustive false effect and disclosure ledger
  + ServiceConfigurationDiagnostic is profile status optional config digest checks exclusive summary or fault privacy and nonauthority

& [ControlFlow]
  + boundedly hash readable config bytes then call existing load_service_config
  + after config success call existing SecretToken from_file and immediately drop the admitted token after validation
  + after token success call existing load_generation and project only safe binding metrics and count
  + stop on the first refusal and map its code to one closed guidance class without copying the raw message

& [FailureModel]
  + invalid invocation is CLI exit two and not a domain report
  + domain validation refusal is one valid report with exit three and no stderr content
  + stdout serialization failure is exit seventy
  + no partial ready summary or multiple fault list can be serialized

& [SevenFold]
  + [source_preserved] operator-product reentry and exact existing validation chain remain cited
  + [delineated] validation public projection mutation startup and production operations are distinct
  + [semantically_refined] ready means the exact current startup artifact validators pass before listener binding
  + [constraint_checked] stage set report shape disclosure list outputs exits and resource bounds are closed
  + [pruned] raw paths tokens messages content repair migration startup provider effects remote FPGA and Minecraft are removed
  + [phase_locked] additive model diagnostic function cantord mode tests checked evidence docs and bundle refresh only
  + [justified] exact preflight reuses mature code and closes the next operator seam without broadening authority
